S3-00 is complete on branch `s3-00-telemetry-store`.

## Acceptance criteria

| # | Status | Notes |
|---|--------|-------|
| 1 Cold-start durability | **PASS** | Increment → force redeploy → get returned `value: 1` |
| 2 Missing env → 5xx | **PASS** | API returns 500 naming `KV_REST_API_URL` / `KV_REST_API_TOKEN` |
| 3 Shared test suite | **PASS** | One file, `memory` + `redis` backends (12 telemetry tests) |

## What was built

**Store:** Upstash for Redis via Vercel Marketplace (`agent-cost-calc-telemetry`, region `iad1`). No prior store existed in the repo; Vercel KV is sunset, so Upstash is the supported replacement with the same `KV_*` env vars.

**Module:** `src/telemetry/store.ts` — `increment`, `get`, `append`, `list` plus in-memory and Redis implementations.

**Endpoints:** `POST /api/telemetry/increment`, `GET /api/telemetry/get` — fail loudly when env vars are unset.

**Deploy config:** Next.js 16.3.1 on Vercel (`sairamprojects/agent-cost-calc`), build region `iad1`, production at https://agent-cost-calc.vercel.app.

