**Next step:** critic review (`glm-review`) per the story protocol — builder does not self-certify.S3-00 is done on branch `s3-00-telemetry-store` (commit `148ea1f`).

A durable telemetry store is in place using **Upstash Redis** via the Vercel Marketplace, with `increment` / `get` / `append` / `list` in `src/telemetry/store.ts`, HTTP probes at `/api/telemetry/increment` and `/api/telemetry/get`, and loud 5xx responses when `KV_REST_API_URL` or `KV_REST_API_TOKEN` are missing.

All three acceptance criteria passed: cold-start durability was proven on production (increment → force redeploy → get still returned `1`), missing-env behavior is tested, and memory + Redis share one test suite (54 tests, evidence gate PASS).

